# MyEnv Clink Readline Configuration

# 1. Ctrl+Space & F7 -> Opens the exact native Boxed Command History Popup Menu (F7 History Menu)
"\C-@": clink-popup-history
"Control-space": clink-popup-history
"\C- ": clink-popup-history
"F7": clink-popup-history

# 2. Tab Key -> File, Directory & Path Completion Menu in ALL cases
"\t": clink-completion-popup
"Tab": clink-completion-popup

# 3. Standard Text Editing & Cursor Movement:
# Left (←) and Right (→) arrows move character-by-character to edit text
